  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The most likely cause of the as-found test failure is disc to seat micro-bonding (seat sticking). Although both 2-MS-242 and 2-MS-245 were upgraded during previous outages from stainless steel disc material to pre-oxidized Inconel X-750 discs, and are therefore less susceptible to seat sticking, a review of industry OE revealed several instances of seat sticking in safety valves with the upgraded material.",
    "cause_code": "TBD",
    "category": "provisional",
    "theme": "disc-to-seat micro-bonding (seat sticking) causing high lift setpoint drift",
    "provisional": true
  },
